# The override seam of the page module category summary, the way an installation
# registers it: a key below the composer package name of `EXT:category_types`,
# pointing at a directory whose `Templates/` folder is searched for
# `PageCategorySummary.html`.
#
# The package name is what makes the key resolve at all. Registered below
# `typo3/cms-backend` instead, the view searches core's template directory and
# nothing else.
templates.fgtclb/category-types.test-override = tests/category-types-summary-override:Resources/Private/Backend
